Flask-Migrate / Alembic migrations for the Business Billing API.

Use from the backend directory with the virtualenv active:

```powershell
flask --app run:app db upgrade
flask --app run:app db current
python scripts\print_alembic_chain.py
```

**Live / existing databases:** follow `docs/03-database/10-industry-modules-ops-runbook.md`.  
Never run `sql/02_schema.sql` on production data.

**Stamp helpers:**

- Phase 8 only (legacy): `python scripts/stamp_alembic_head.py`
- Industry head (tables already present): `python scripts/stamp_alembic_industry_head.py`

Current head: `20260826_biz66_perf_indexes` (see `docs/03-database/11-alembic-revision-order.md`).
